    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0780cab4",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "genocide",
      "label": "Genocide",
      "description": "Genocide is the deliberate and systematic destruction of a racial, political, or cultural group. The Holocaust is the most infamous example of genocide in modern history. The meme's use of 'Auschwitz' (a concentration camp) as a punchline for a pickup line reduces the gravity of genocide to a joke about dating, which is a form of historical revisionism and dehumanization.",
