    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_5b25264a",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "anti_semitism",
      "label": "Anti-Semitism",
      "description": "Anti-Semitism is prejudice, hostility, or discrimination against Jewish people. It has a long and violent history, including the Holocaust. The meme's use of 'Auschwitz' to refer to a Jewish person is a direct and offensive reference to anti-Semitic tropes that dehumanize Jewish people and reduce their suffering to a joke. This is a form of hate speech and historical revisionism.",
